---
import RouteShell from "../components/RouteShell.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<RouteShell
  title="Privacy Policy | Miami Knife Guy"
  description="How Miami Knife Guy uses privacy-friendly website analytics and handles service-request information."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="panel" aria-hidden="false">
    <div class="panel-inner">
      <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="sub-eyebrow">Miami Knife Guy</p>
        <h1 class="sub-headline-cyan text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6">Privacy policy.</h1>
        <div class="space-y-7 text-white/62 text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
          <p>Miami Knife Guy uses privacy-friendly analytics to understand page visits and service-request actions. This information helps improve the website and make the service flow easier to use.</p>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Aggregate website analytics</h2>
            <p>The site may measure aggregate actions such as booking clicks, phone taps, review-link clicks, referral visits, and prepared request messages. These measurements are used to understand which pages and service paths are useful.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Information excluded from analytics</h2>
            <p>The analytics setup is designed not to collect names, phone numbers, email addresses, restaurant names, neighborhoods, message text, selected photos, form-field values, or referral codes. Information you submit to the sharpening assistant is handled separately as described below.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Service requests</h2>
            <p>When you intentionally submit a public request form, the contact and service details you entered are saved to the private MKG Growth Engine so Sean can respond. The site also prepares a text message or device share action as a direct-contact backup.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Sharpening assistant and photos</h2>
            <p>Messages and photos you submit through the sharpening assistant may be sent to an AI service to answer questions and prepare estimates. Chat text, the assistant's response, and basic photo metadata may be saved to the private CRM; raw selected photo files are not copied into Firestore CRM storage. Do not upload identification, payment information, medical records, or unrelated personal material. Photo assessments and chatbot pricing are estimates; Sean confirms the work and final price.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Scheduling texts</h2>
            <p>If you request a service window and consent to texts, Miami Knife Guy saves your name, mobile number, service address when pickup is requested, timing preference, request summary, and consent choice in the private CRM to coordinate availability. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out of automated service texts.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white/88">Questions</h2>
            <p>For privacy questions, call or text Miami Knife Guy at <a class="text-cyan-300 underline underline-offset-4" href="tel:+13059095773">305-909-5773</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</RouteShell>
